    },
    "Aquí verás cada cobro, gasto y pago de esta cuenta, con su saldo. Si pusiste dinero de tu bolsillo para empezar, regístralo aquí." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Here you'll see every payment received, expense and payment made in this account, with its balance. If you put in your own money to get started, record it here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí verás cómo va tu negocio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is where you’ll see how your business is doing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aquí verás los pagos programados, las facturas vencidas y el impuesto por declarar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scheduled payments, overdue invoices and sales tax to file will show up here."
