    "Un asiento es el registro contable de un movimiento. Chirogra los hace solo cuando facturas, cobras o anotas un gasto." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A journal entry is the accounting record of a transaction. Chirogra makes them on its own when you invoice, get paid or add an expense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un asiento necesita al menos dos líneas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A journal entry needs at least two lines."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un estimado es un presupuesto: le dices al cliente cuánto costará antes de empezar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An estimate is a quote: you tell the customer what it will cost before you start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Un estimado no registra nada en la contabilidad. Al convertirlo en factura se crea un borrador." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An estimate doesn't record anything in your books. Converting it creates a draft invoice."
